{"seq":2,"slug":"writing-skills","title":"高二英语 — 写作技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/english/exam-preparation/writing-skills","wordCount":1802,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二英语-写作技巧\">高二英语 — 写作技巧</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>英语写作是高考中主观性最强的板块，也是拉开分数差距的关键。高二阶段需要从&quot;写正确的句子&quot;进阶到&quot;写出有结构、有逻辑、有亮点的文章&quot;。无论是应用文写作还是读后续写，扎实的写作技巧都能显著提升得分。</p>\n<p>本节核心内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高考写作题型分析</strong>：应用文写作与读后续写的要求差异</li>\n<li><strong>高分作文的评分维度</strong>：内容、结构、语言、卷面</li>\n<li><strong>句式升级策略</strong>：从简单句到复杂句的进阶方法</li>\n<li><strong>应用文写作模板与灵活运用</strong></li>\n<li><strong>读后续写的情节设计与语言衔接</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-高考写作题型与评分标准\">一、高考写作题型与评分标准</h3><p><strong>应用文写作</strong>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 词）：书信、通知、邀请函、投稿等。要求格式规范、要点完整、语言得体。</p>\n<p><strong>读后续写</strong>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 词）：根据给定的故事开头续写两段，要求情节合理、与原文衔接自然、语言生动。</p>\n<p><strong>评分的四个维度</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容与要点</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>所有要点都有涉及，信息完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>篇章结构</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>段落划分合理，逻辑连贯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言质量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>语法正确，词汇丰富，句式多样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>书写规范</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>字迹工整，卷面整洁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-句式升级策略\">二、句式升级策略</h3><p>阅卷老师在短时间内阅读大量作文，丰富的句式能让你的文章脱颖而出。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 1：简单句</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>I like reading. Reading can help me learn new things.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Level 2：并列句和复合句</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>I like reading because it helps me learn new things and broadens my horizons.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Level 3：高级句式</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>句式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强调句</td>\n<td><em>It is reading <strong>that</strong> has broadened my horizons significantly.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒装句</td>\n<td><em><strong>Not only</strong> does reading enrich my knowledge, <strong>but it also</strong> improves my writing skills.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非谓语动词</td>\n<td><em><strong>Exposed to</strong> diverse cultures through reading, I have developed a more open mind.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定语从句</td>\n<td><em>Reading, <strong>which is my favorite hobby</strong>, has helped me understand different perspectives.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同位语从句</td>\n<td><em>The fact <strong>that reading improves cognitive abilities</strong> has been proven by numerous studies.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>with 复合结构</td>\n<td><em><strong>With so many books to choose from</strong>, I never feel bored in my free time.</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实用升级对照表</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>普通表达</th>\n<th>升级表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I think...</td>\n<td>From my perspective, ... / As far as I am concerned, ...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>very important</td>\n<td>of great significance / play a vital role in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>more and more</td>\n<td>an increasing number of / a growing proportion of</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>We should...</td>\n<td>It is highly recommended that we (should)...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I want to...</td>\n<td>I am eager to... / I have a strong desire to...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-应用文写作框架\">三、应用文写作框架</h3><p><strong>书信类基本结构</strong>：</p>\n<p>开头（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 句）：说明写信目的</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>I am writing to invite you to attend our school&#39;s annual English Drama Festival.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>主体（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 句）：展开要点，每个要点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 句</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>The festival will be held on December 15th in the school auditorium. We have prepared a variety of performances, including classic Shakespearean plays and modern short dramas. As an exchange student with a passion for theater, you would be a perfect audience member.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>结尾（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 句）：表达期待或感谢</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>I sincerely hope you can make it. Looking forward to your reply.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>不同场景的开头句式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>开头句</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>邀请</td>\n<td>I am writing to invite you to...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申请</td>\n<td>I am writing to apply for the position of...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议</td>\n<td>I am writing to offer some suggestions on...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感谢</td>\n<td>I am writing to express my sincere gratitude for...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投稿</td>\n<td>I am writing to contribute an article to your newspaper about...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>道歉</td>\n<td>I am writing to apologize for...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-读后续写的核心技巧\">四、读后续写的核心技巧</h3><p>读后续写的关键是<strong>情节合理</strong>和<strong>语言衔接</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>情节设计的原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>紧扣原文线索——续写的情节必须基于原文已有的人物、事件和伏笔</li>\n<li>注意段首句的提示——每段的首句已给出，续写内容必须与之吻合</li>\n<li>情感弧线要完整——通常从困难/冲突走向解决/成长</li>\n<li>避免过于离奇的情节——不要引入新角色或完全改变故事方向</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>描写技巧提升</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>描写类型</th>\n<th>普通写法</th>\n<th>生动写法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高兴</td>\n<td>She was very happy.</td>\n<td>A wave of joy washed over her, and her eyes sparkled with delight.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>害怕</td>\n<td>He was scared.</td>\n<td>His heart pounded violently against his chest, and his palms were drenched in cold sweat.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悲伤</td>\n<td>She felt sad.</td>\n<td>Tears streamed down her cheeks as a lump formed in her throat.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惊讶</td>\n<td>He was surprised.</td>\n<td>His jaw dropped and his eyes widened in disbelief.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>环境描写服务于情感</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开心时：<em>The sun broke through the clouds, casting a warm golden glow over the garden.</em></li>\n<li>紧张时：<em>Dark clouds gathered overhead, and the wind howled through the empty streets.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>衔接词确保段落连贯</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间顺序：<em>At that moment, Shortly after, No sooner had... than...</em></li>\n<li>因果关系：<em>Consequently, As a result, It was then that...</em></li>\n<li>转折：<em>However, To her surprise, Much to his astonishment</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-常见错误与避免方法\">五、常见错误与避免方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>正确写法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中式英语</td>\n<td><em>I very like English.</em></td>\n<td><em>I like English very much.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时态混乱</td>\n<td><em>Yesterday I go to school and study hard.</em></td>\n<td><em>Yesterday I went to school and studied hard.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主谓不一致</td>\n<td><em>The number of people are increasing.</em></td>\n<td><em>The number of people is increasing.</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搭配错误</td>\n<td><em>improve my ability for English</em></td>\n<td><em>improve my English ability</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑跳跃</td>\n<td>从讨论学习直接跳到旅游，无过渡</td>\n<td>使用过渡句衔接不同话题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>考前自查清单</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时态是否一致？（应用文通常用一般现在/将来时；读后续写用一般过去时）</li>\n<li>人称是否前后统一？</li>\n<li>是否覆盖了所有要点？</li>\n<li>字数是否达标？</li>\n<li>有没有低级语法错误？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>将以下简单句升级为至少包含一个高级句式的复杂句：<ul>\n<li><em>We should protect the environment. It is important for our future.</em></li>\n<li><em>She studied hard. She passed the exam.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>以&quot;邀请外国朋友参加学校文化节&quot;为题，写一篇约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> 词的应用文。</li>\n<li>给定续写段首句：<em>The moment she opened the door, she froze.</em> 续写一段约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> 词的内容，要求使用至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 种感官描写。</li>\n<li>找出以下段落中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个错误并改正：<blockquote>\n<p><em>Dear Tom, I writing to tell you that our school will held a sports meeting next week. There are many activity you can join. I hope you can came.</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>对照评分标准，给自己最近一篇英语作文打分，找出最需要提升的维度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>英语写作能力的提升离不开&quot;输入&quot;。研究表明，大量阅读与写作能力之间存在显著的正相关——阅读量大的学生，其词汇量、句式多样性和语感都优于阅读量少的学生。</p>\n<p>高考英语写作的评分越来越注重&quot;语言的真实运用能力&quot;。生搬硬套模板的作文越来越难获得高分，而能灵活运用语言、展现个人思考的文章则更受青睐。建议在平时积累 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频表达和句型，在不同话题中灵活应用，而不是背诵整篇范文。</p>\n<p>推荐每周进行一次限时写作训练：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟完成一篇应用文和一段读后续写，然后花 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟自我修改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高考写作的核心评分维度是内容完整性和语言质量</li>\n<li>句式升级（强调句、倒装句、非谓语动词）是提分的有效手段</li>\n<li>应用文要格式规范、要点齐全、语言得体</li>\n<li>读后续写的关键是情节合理、描写生动、与原文衔接自然</li>\n<li>写作是一项需要持续练习的技能——写得多、改得勤，才能进步快</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二英语 — 写作技巧","id":"高二英语-写作技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、高考写作题型与评分标准","id":"一-高考写作题型与评分标准"},{"level":3,"text":"二、句式升级策略","id":"二-句式升级策略"},{"level":3,"text":"三、应用文写作框架","id":"三-应用文写作框架"},{"level":3,"text":"四、读后续写的核心技巧","id":"四-读后续写的核心技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"五、常见错误与避免方法","id":"五-常见错误与避免方法"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二英语 — 阅读策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/english/exam-preparation/reading-strategies"},"next":{"title":"高二英语 — 听说训练","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/english/exam-preparation/listening-speaking"}}